7Z","updated_at":"2020-05-07T20:58:37Z","body":"If you'd like to get the WiX developers involved in this thread, I suggest you contact them through their \"wix-dev\" mailing list - https://wixtoolset.org/documentation/mailinglist/\r\n\r\nSorry if anything I wrote came across as snarky, that wasn't my intention.\r\n\r\nAs I'm not part of the WiX team, I'm just a user of WiX and a fan of the SPDX system, there's not really anything more I can contribute here, so I'll gracefully bow out of this thread now.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\n\r\nJon","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/625493962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/625520813","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979#issuecomment-625520813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979","id":625520813,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyNTUyMDgxMw==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users