79#issuecomment-659209646","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979","id":659209646,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1OTIwOTY0Ng==","user":{"login":"robmen","id":131904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTkwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen","html_url":"https://github.com/robmen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robmen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-16T07:18:15Z","updated_at":"2020-07-16T07:18:15Z","body":"@jlovejoy has it right. The WiX Toolset is available under the MS-RL.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of the extra text is this:\r\n\r\n> Sometimes the reciprocal license is incorrectly interpreted...\r\n\r\nI requested that Outercurve Foundation provide us a small blurb of text to serve as a quick rebuttal to corporate lawyers who argued the MS-RL was viral. Outercurve provided the text and it was reaffirmed by .NET Foundation when the WiX Toolset copyright was transferred (due to Outercurve's closure).\r\n\r\nThat blurb has served its purpose extremely well for over a decade now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/659209646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/714603233","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979#issuecomment-714603233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979","id":714603233,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNDYwMzIzMw==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-22T16:16:20Z","updated_at":"2020-10-22T16:16:20Z","body":"coming back to this - I only see this text on the website, but it does not appear to be included WITH the MS-RL in the LICENSE.txt file. We have not included other \"commentary\" about licenses on websites, should we do so here? Would that then set a dangerous precedent?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/714603233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/714608906","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979#issuecomment-714608906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/979","id":714608906,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNDYwODkwNg==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-22T16:25:05Z","updated_at":"2020-10-22T16:25:05Z","body":"Discussed on 2020-10-22 SPDX legal team call. Since the text appears on the website, but does not appear to be included in any of the WiX code itself, it doesn't appear to fit the typical model of being a license exception used in code. \r\n\r\nIf the WiX project plans to incorporate it into its code, then it might be more appropriately viewed as an exception / modification that is appropriate for inclusion on the exceptions list. But if it remains just on the website, it seems closer to commentary interpreting the license, rather than an actual exception to MS-RL.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/714608906/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]